*   **Expected Output**: `[false, "^[a-z0-9!#$%&'*+/=?^_`{|}~-]+(?:\\.[a-z0-9!#$%&'*+/=?^_`{|}~-]+)*@(?:[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*\\.)+[a-z]{2,}$"]`
*   **How the code handles this**:
